1	// Acceptance test for the change request:
2	//   "Invoices should move through stages. First a draft. Then I send it. Then it gets paid. Keep a
3	//    record when I send one. Only let me take payment once it has been sent."
4	//
5	// An invoice moves through three stages: DRAFT → SENT → PAID. On a project's detail page each invoice
6	// shows its stage (invoice-status). While it is a DRAFT it offers a control to send it
7	// (invoice-send-<id>) and NO control to take payment — payment is only offered once it has been SENT
